            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Normally, affixing more than one talisman to an item causes the talismans to be suppressed, but when you Affix a Talisman, you can specially treat one item you're working on, allowing it to have two active talismans at once. This special treatment ends if you use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Affix a Talisman] to treat a new item for this ability.</p>"
          },
